  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A thermodynamic cycle consisting of an adiabatic, isovolumetric and isothermal processes is shown.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>Which of the following correctly identifies the processes of the cycle?</p>\n<table><tbody><tr><td></td><td><p>Adiabatic</p></td><td><p>Isovolumetric</p></td><td><p>Isothermal</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"A\"><td><p>A.</p></td><td><p>X→Y</p></td><td><p>Y→Z</p></td><td><p>Z→X</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"B\"><td><p>B.</p></td><td><p>Z→X</p></td><td><p>X→Y</p></td><td><p>Y→Z</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"C\"><td><p>C.</p></td><td><p>Z→X</p></td><td><p>Y→Z</p></td><td><p>X→Y</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"D\"><td><p>D.</p></td><td><p>Y→Z</p></td><td><p>Z→X</p></td><td><p>X→Y</p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>[1]</p>"
